        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Worm Trill"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(auditory, concentrate, enchantment, mental, primal)\n\nThe frost worm emits a hypnotic trill. Each non\u2013frost worm creature within 100 feet must attempt a 32 Will save. The effects of Worm Trill last for 1 round, but if the frost worm uses this ability again on subsequent rounds, it extends this duration by 1 round for any creature already affected.\n\n- **Success:** The creature is unaffected and is immune to Worm Trill for 24 hours.\n- **Failure:** The creature is fascinated by the frost worm.\n- **Critical Failure:** As failure, but the fascinated condition doesn't end if the frost worm uses hostile actions against the creature."
            },
